+	help
+	  Enables support for RZ/N1 SoC timers.
+	  A timers block in RZ/N1 SoCs is composed of 8 timers
+	    - 6 16-bit timers
+	    - 2 32-bit timers
+	  Two timers blocks are available in RZ/N1 SoCs.
