gpio_regmap is opaque, drivers cannot access the embedded gpio_chip directly.

Suggested-by: Andy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@linux.intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Yu-Chun Lin <eleanor.lin@realtek.com>
